ge</strong> - Face several enemy types, each with different mechanics designed to keep you on your toes and test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Wave Generation</strong> - A sophisticated wave generation system ensures no two runs are ever the same, keeping every playthrough fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable Difficulty</strong> - Five different difficulty levels that enhance fun and challenge rather than simply adjusting numbers, making the game more interesting at every skill level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Wave</strong>\u00a0- Survive long enough to face one of several different bosses!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513400?t=1759721625","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513400?t=1759721625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513400/54027737ab4031e5c3c306337248bd3f9e4ab82b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759721625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513400/54027737ab4031e5c3c306337248bd3f9e4ab82b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759721625","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE ARENA</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513400/extras/792ef0368d485831698706aa99ff2262.poster.avif?t=1759721625\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513400/extras/792ef0368d485831698706aa99ff2262.webm?t=1759721625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/